            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nInvite User and New User need a connected user with the **Tenant Admin** or **User Admin** role. The flow invites appmixer-e2e-qlik@example.com and deletes that user at the end (Make API Call DELETE /api/v1/users/{id}), so the email can be invited again on the next run. The Wait lets the New User webhook settle before the invitation."
